{"mangaRefs":["file-674-676"],"locationRefs":["location-beika-town"],"summary":{"en":"The nearly hired maid and adviser inform Conan of Jirokichi's strange behavior. They reveal that after dinner, two plates are always missing and Jirokichi always brings his cane with him to the safe. Jirokichi asks the maid for a hand and they head to his room. Jirokichi leaves with his bodyguard for a drive. Shortly after, an unconscious Jirokichi is found tied up and his room and a note of Kaitou Kid is found on the safe. This causes the whole police force that are guarding the safe to abandon their position and chase after \"Jirokichi\".","zhHans":"怪盗基德相关作品以预告、变装、宝石目标和柯南的追踪对决为核心，属于独立角色专题线。","zhHant":"","legacy":true,"sourcePage":"Kaitou_Kid_vs._the_Strongest_Safe","sourceQuote":true},"characters":["character-conan-edogawa","character-kaito-kid","character-ran-mouri","character-kogoro-mouri","character-ai-haibara","character-shintaro-chaki","character-azusa-enomoto","character-ninzaburo-shiratori","character-kazunobu-chiba","character-jirokichi-suzuki","character-detective-okumura","character-ginzo-nakamori","character-detective-sugita","character-mitsuhiko-tsuburaya","character-wataru-takagi","character-detective-nakamura","character-juzo-megure","character-kaitou-kid","character-sonoko-suzuki","character-detective-takikawa","character-ayumi-yoshida","character-kiyonaga-matsumoto","character-genta-kojima","character-detective-fukui","character-samizu-kichiemon"],"organizations":[],"locations":[],"gadgets":[],"caseTypes":["disguise","heist","rival-detectives"],"sources":["src-abiting-conan-database","src-detective-conan-world-anime"],"detailStatus":"reviewed","coverage":{"directory":true,"basicFacts":true,"structure":true,"deepSpoilers":true},"raw":{"manga":"Vol. 65","specialLabel":null,"rawIndex":537,"dcwMangaSource":"V64 - F11 ~ V65 - F2(674-676)","dcwMangaKind":"manga","dcwAirDate":"June 20, 2009"},"season":14,"solvedByRaw":"Conan Edogawa","solvedBy":"character-conan-edogawa",